@Gateway = http://localhost:5100
@orderId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Ürünler (→ Inventory /products)
GET {{Gateway}}/api/products

### Sipariş ver: 1 klavye → Confirmed (→ Ordering /orders)
POST {{Gateway}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa", "items": [ { "productId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111", "quantity": 1 } ] }

### Sipariş ver: 2 monitör (13000) → ödeme reddi → Rejected + stok Released (compensation)
POST {{Gateway}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa", "items": [ { "productId": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333", "quantity": 2 } ] }

### Sipariş ver: 100 klavye → stok yok → Rejected
POST {{Gateway}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa", "items": [ { "productId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111", "quantity": 100 } ] }

### Siparişler
GET {{Gateway}}/api/orders

### Sipariş
GET {{Gateway}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}

### Saga durumu
GET {{Gateway}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/saga

### Kargola / iptal et
POST {{Gateway}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/ship

###
POST {{Gateway}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel

### Rezervasyonlar (→ Inventory)
GET {{Gateway}}/api/reservations?orderId={{orderId}}

### Ödemeler (→ Payment)
GET {{Gateway}}/api/payments?orderId={{orderId}}

### API Composition: Ordering + Payment + Inventory paralel çağrılır, tek yanıt döner
GET {{Gateway}}/api/order-details/{{orderId}}

### Gateway sağlık
GET {{Gateway}}/health
